        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 7685, Dummy Cylinder Wiltshire Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA dummy handleset, the Weslock made Wiltshire Entry Handleset is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. This 19-1/4 inch outside trim handleset made by Weslock not only looks fantastic, it is made with the attention to quality Weslock is known for. The Wiltshire Arched Handleset will be sure to make an impression. The beveled edges paired with the curved handle are a picture of elegance and subtle beauty. The Wiltshire handleset will add a touch of simple richness to your doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/wiltshire-single-cylinder-entrance-set-weslock-7680-7600\"><b>Wiltshire Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditionally styled handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-molten-bronze-collection\"><b>Weslock Molten Bronze Collection</b></a> which features easy installation as well as lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Wiltshire Weslock Dummy Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid molten bronze.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Molten Bronze Wiltshire Weslock Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 19-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
